"'''{{PAGENAME}}'''" is a Mainline Quest in ''[[Wizard101]]'' and the 77th Mainline Quest for the [[Wallaru]] storyline. It was released on the Live Realm with the rest of the Wallaru expansion on November 27, 2023. The Quest continues from "[[Heroes of Old]]" and leads to the Instance Quest "[[The Man on the Moon is the Engineer]]," which returns here upon completion and leads to "[[Dreams of Nothing]]."

